Francis: Still. Tell me. Nate: Kuch zyaada batane ko hai hee nahi. Drove up to her place, picked her up, went for a nice dinner and then cinema and finally to that spot. Francis: konsa spot? Nate: How many spots are there?! U a virgin or what? Francis: Ah! The love hill! Aisa bolna chahiye tha naa. Nate: Having really good time there. Francis: So far so good. So what went wrong? Nate: Getting there. Francis: Sry. Nate: After everything voh chahti thi that i drop her home and then it started! Francis: Scream 2? Nate: Sod off. The bloody thing start hee nahi ho rahi thi. Francis: Walk back all the way? Nate: Nah. Worse. Maine usse dhaka maarne ke liye bola. Francis: W8. What?! Nate: Yeah. She doesn't have a driver's licence. Francis: Still! Nate: She didn't mind. She did give me a push. The car went downhill, but wouldn't start or stop. Francis: So what happened? Nate: Well, let's say it's no longer with us and I got billed for the removal of the vehicle. Francis: So tum log vapas kaise aaye? Nate: Taxi bulai aur kya? Francis: Kitne paise diye? Nate: 200. Francis: Ur Shitting me? Nate: Nah. Nayi car chahiye. Francis: Want me to come with u? Nate: Nah. Abhi paise kamm hai. Maybe some other day. Francis: Whenever, man. Whenever. Nate: Yeah.
