Alex: Hi. kya mai tumse baat kar sakta huu? Lesley: Hi. Tum kon ho? Alex: Mera naam Alex hai. Tum mujhe jaante nahi, 'cause hum abhi Facebook pe friends nahi hai , bt mere paas kuch important hai tumhe batane ko. Lesley: Ok... Alex: Kya tumne green wind turbines ke baare mein suna hai? Lesley: Wind turbines jo green paint kar dee hai? Alex: No, like ecological ones. Lesley: Aren't they all? Alex: Yes, probably, but yeh bahut eco friendly hai. Lesley: Ok... Alex: So these wind turbines birds ko maar rahi hai. Lesley: Murder karne waali wind turbines? Sounds like a horror-film-plot ;) Alex: I'm serious. Mai last weekend fields pe tha jab maine yeh qt jaybird ko wings of wind turbine mein torn hote hue dekha. Lesley: That's awful. Alex: I know. Maine thodi research kari and it turns out that thousands of birds har saal iss tarah marti hai. Lesley: So? Alex: This is really important. Maine ek petition bana yahai to the government and chahta huu tum sign karo. Lesley: Y? Alex: Don't u care about the birds? Lesley: I do. Alex: toh kya tum Petion pe sign karogi? Lesley: What are you petitioning? Alex: Ban on wind turbines. Lesley: No. Alex: Y not? Lesley: 'cause yeh ek bekaar idea hai. Alex: But the birds marr rahi hai! Lesley: Mujhe text karna band karo. Alex: Yeh kaafi important hai Lesley: And this is spam.
