Mike: Sabse ajeeb cheez tumne seed se kya ugai hai? Luke: Heh heh. tum iss sawal kaa javaab nahi jaana chahte. Mike: mera matlab drugs ke alawa, of course. Luke: Maine ek baar Avocado ugaya tha. Mike: pathar se? Luke: Yeah, but mujhe kabhi samjh nhi aaya kee unhe bahut bada kaise ugaye. kuch samay baad voh marr jaate hai. Mike: Aur kuch? Luke: mere paas chote grapefruits, oranges and lemons hai, but voh bhi kuch zyaada ache nahi bane. Mere paas achi conditions nahi hai. But jo sabse acha jo maine banaya tha voh ek baar stairwell pe banaya tha. Mike: stairwell pe? Luke: Yes, mai ghar aaya kyuki mujhe bahut zaruri ek bag chahiye tha. Phir maine dekha kee maine apni keys college ke locker mein hee chodh dee. So I just had to crimp one out and the only place to do it was in the pot of this yucca plant that actually belonged to the neighbour. Mike: tum apne neighbour ke plant pot mein hug diye? Luke: Yeah. mai phirse college nahi jaa paaunga leaving this sticking soft shit on view in my neighbour's plant pot toh maine usse dusre pot kee mitti se cover kar diya aur chupa diya. Mike: And usse kabhi pata nahi chala? Luke: Mai keys lene gaya, vapas aaya. Vaha thodi see smell thi aur maine windows khol dee, phir uske baare mein kuch nahi socha. Mike: Aur phir usme se kya nikla, a shit plant? Luke: Nope, thode hafto baad bahut saare tomatoes aane lage. Iskme sabse bevkoofi waali baat yeh thi kee padosi ne voh tomatoes face value pe le liye unhe ugaya aur phir tab khaaye jab voh phir se aye
