Joe: Hi Kels, aajkal tum kya kar rahi ho? Kelly: Oh my God, Joe Johnson, Kitne saal ho gaye! Joe: Yes, mai 3 saal se abroad kaam kar rahi thi, Italy, actually! Kelly: Badiya! Kya voh tumhari girlfriend Josie ke saath? Joe: Yes, asal mein 2 saal pehle we got married! Unfortunately, voh itna lamba nahi chala and we split after a year and a half. Kelly: Yeh sunke bahut bura laga, Joe! Kya hua tha? Joe: Well, voh her jagah kaam karti thi aur mai mushkil se usse milta tha, Mai uske parents ke ghar pe reh raha tha aur uske bhai ke garage mein kaam kar raha tha. Kelly: Hmm, Mujhe lag raha hai abhi ek "lekin" aane waala hai! Joe: Haan, well, I'm not proud of this, but uski behan Uni ke baad vapas aa gayi thi aur ek raat hum bhand ho gaye on Prosecco and brandy, jo kee ek acha combo nahi hai! Kelly: Mujhe lagta hai mai aage kee kahani guess kar sakti huu. Voh sab waha vaise bhi kyu reh rahe the? Joe: Well, agar tumhe yaad ho, Josie kaa last name Andellino hai aur uske dad apne mom aur dad kaa dhyaan rakhne vapas chale gaye the jaha se voh aaye the. Anyway, Maine Josie ko sach bata diya kee kya hua tha. humne kuch mahine aur koshish kari, but voh itna time duur rehti thi toh maine ek din sab khatam kar diya. Kelly: ab tum iss lovely Newport mein vapas aa gaye ho after the splendour of Rome! Joe: Bilkul sahi. Tony ke saath mujhe meri aakhri job bhi mil gayi! Voh bank kaisa hai? Kelly: Abhi bhi vahi hai! Mai training mein jaa chuka huu aur mera line manager jaldi retire hone waala hai, kya pata ek aur promotion ho jaaye! Joe: Tumjhare liye khush huu, Kels! You are a real people person! Kelly: Thanks Joe! Ab uss drink kaa kya? Joe: Good memory, Kelly! Tumhe kya batau, Mai bank mein aa jaaunga friday ko jab voh band ho jaata hai aur phir hum decide karenge. Tony mujhe aadha ghanta pehle chodne mein bura nahi maanega, I do plenty of overtime! Kelly: Badiya, Joe! Looking forward to it! Joe: Arriverderci, bella! Kelly: See you, mate!
