Anna: Mai Tom ki jaan le lungi aaj. Lisa: Kya hua? Anna: Can you imagine usne poore din se baby ka diaper nahi change kiya? Lisa: Hai bhagwan, nahi. Anna: Yes. the smell, the view jab maine Stevie ko finally change kiya - priceless Lisa: Kuch kaha tune? Anna: Haan, I said: Are you fucking kidding me? Pagal hai kya tu? Lisa: And...? Anna: He said thoda sa susu kisi ko nuksaan nahi pohocha raha and that I'm overreacting Lisa: Typical. Usne kabhi admit kiya hai ki he screwed up? Anna: Mujhe sach mei yaad nahi aa raha the last time he apologized to me. And ye kaafi thakaan de raha hai, you know. Lisa: I know, tu chahegi ki Sam usse baat kare? You know I can stir him into the right direction, wo usse sahi mei sochne pe majboor kar dega Anna: Pata nahi... wo bas naraaz hi hoga. Lisa: Sam par? Anna: Mujh par. Lisa: Oh, I see. Maybe tujhe try karna chayiye baat karne ka, but like serious for once, not just in regards to you know, kuch ek cheez he messed up, but uska general attitude. Anna: Haan mujhe pata hai, but mai bas thaki hui rehti hu poora time, I get mad and fir mai bas chhod deti hu. Lisa: What do you say hum Steve ko teri behen ke paas chhod deta hai and go to a SPA for a day during the weekend? A nice massage and a facial? Could only do you good. Anna: Ye kaafi badhiya hoga. Lisa: Mai call karti hu Dream SPA ko later today. Khush hoga. Sab theek hoga. Anna: I love you <3 Thanks!!
