Betty: <file_other> Betty: Maybe tujhe apni diet ke baare mei dekh lena chayiye :D: Steven: Esa lagta hai ki aajkal kuch kar hi nahi sakte Steven: Har cheez ke contact mei aane se cancer ho jaata hai:( Steven: Ye raha mera opinion - life causes death Betty: Seriously tumhe ye ignore nahi karna chayiye! Steven: Chal na. Agar tumhe cancer causing things avoid karni hai, toh tumhe jungle mei chale jaana chayiye on a different planet and ek space suit pehen lena chayiye. Steven: Jo tumne list bheji usme theris is UV radiation se bhi cancer hota hai. Steven: Matlab ki literally daylight can make you sick. Betty: It's about long-term exposure. Steven: Yup. Summer mei bahar time spend karne se tumhe cancer ho jayega. Betty: Scientific reasearch ko neglect mat karo. Steven: Mai nahi kar raha. But I just think ki life itni chhoti hai ki har cheez pe paagal ho jao Steven: Mai full support karta hu fighting with smoking in saarvjanik jagah, logo ko smoke karne se rokna, diverse diet shuru karna and unhealthy food avoid karna. Steven: But mai honestly surprised hu ki scientist devote itna zyada time to analyze cancer kese hota hai, and abhi bhi uska cure nahi. Steven: Jitna zyada hum world ko study kare, jitne zyada padarth ko hum analyze kare, jitna zyada hum analyze kare utne zyada conclusions aate hai humare paas. Steven: Toh bhavishye mei hume shayad pata chale ki literally har cheez se cancer hota hai because that's how ye duniya programmed hai Betty: I'm no radical paranoic Steve mai just keh rahi hu, ki agar tumhe additional risk se apne apko expose nahi karna, toh mat kar.
