Carol: Hello my dear, summer kesa raha iss saal? Australia ki heatwaves ke baare mei kaafi sunne ko milta hai. Resa: Zyada bura nahi! Shayad se zyada garmi thi than average but rarely above 30. Pleasant tha kaafi Resa: Agar tum hamare saath rehti toh, I image tum poore time pool mei rehti. Carol: Haan mai toh rehti. Are you? Resa: No. Jaanti toh hai tu mujhe. Resa: Bill ne aaj ENT doc ko dekha. Ek MRI scan hoga us pe to determine if he has growths on the ear nerves. Carol: Kyaa?! Iska kya matlab? Carol: Any suspicion of spreading???? Resa: No, doc keh raha hai ki ye usually benign hote hai. Carol: Thank goodness for that. Resa: Dheere dheere badh raha hai, but nerve pe jo damage hai wo issue hai. Carol: Koi hearing problems bhi hai? Resa: Mai frustrated hu becuase jo bhi Bill ne suffer kiya hai, maine usse bola tha ki medical attention le le and usne mana kar diya. Aur ab wo suffer kar raha hai (and mai bhi) from lack of preventive care. Carol: Typical male. Thomas bhi alag nahi hai. Carol: Of course the partner suffers along, kabhi kabhi toh zyada bhi. Resa: So true... Resa: Kaafi bura hai ye carol. Hum kabhi decent conversation nahi kar paate. Wo ab TV nahi dekh sakta. Carol: Ye toh kaafi bura hai. So sorry for you. Carol: Hearing aids ka kya? Wo bhi mana kar diya?? Carol: But usse toh television kaafi pasand tha! Resa: Ek aur challenge to deal with. Resa: Hearing aid toh aa jayegi once the deafness is diagnosed. Carol: Meri mother in law ke paas earplugs the jo TV se connect ho jaate the via Bluetooth, toh she could walk around the room and still hear tv. Carol: Mera matlab hai ki technology toh hai lene ke liye. Resa: Haan, ye toh badhiya option hai. Resa: Hum ussi raaste jayenge I'm sure. Carol: Tu kaafi bahadur and strong woman hai Theresa! Resa: Thank you dear. Mujhe pata hai ki I'm strong. And that keeps us both going. Carol: Lucky Bill to have you!
