Sebastian: Hi, kesi hai? Betty: Hi, I'm fine, thanks for asking. Tu kesa hai? Sebastian: I'm fine too… kaafi time ho gaya Betty: Yeah, kaafi zyada time ho gaya Sebastian: Tune mujhse baat karni hi chhod di Betty: Well, mai sure nahi tha ki tu mujhse baat karna chahta hai Sebastian: Why so? Betty: I don't know, mujhe bas esa laga Sebastian: Humari last conversation ke baad? Betty: Exactly. Sebastian: Well… tujhe pata hai mujhe sirf teen din hi aana tha Betty: I know, but mujhe laga ki hum ab kabhi nahi milenge… Sebastian: But you know, if we're supposed to meet one day,hum milenge Betty: Yeah and ye esa lag raha hai jese "one day = never" Sebastian: Ek din tune bhi mujhe esa sa hi answer diya tha… Betty: So now we're 1:1 :P Sebastian: And tu khush hai iss baare mei? Betty: Well… not really? But agar esa hua… Sebastian: Uh… see, mai next week Paris aa raha hu, milna chahegi? It'll be nice to see you again Betty: Kab exactly? Sebastian: Monday till Thursday. Betty: Tuesday ka theek? Meri poori afternoon free hai Sebastian: Perfect! Mai bohot khush hu :) Betty: Me too.. Nice that we'll see each other again
Jack: Hey. Karolina: Hi. Jack: Kesa chal raha hai? Karolina: It could be better, actually. Jack: I'm sorry to hear that. Kya hua? Karolina: Well, Maine ek aur saal college start kiya mai iss super cheap apartment mei hu jabse mai yaha aya, but ab the landlord wants to kick me out.. Jack: Kyu? Karolina: His son was working abroad, but ab wo wapas aa raha hai and needs the apartment to live. Jack: Oh, that sucks. Karolina: Yeah. mujhe koi idea nahi hai ki mai kya karungi. Itna asaan nahi hai to find places after school year has started. Jack: Ye bohot mushkil hai to find them before school starts, let alone after. Karolina: Tell me about it. mai har jagah dekh raha hu but mujhe kuch nahi mila. Well, not ki mai afford bhi kar sakta hu ya nahi. Jack: Tu school kaha jaa raha hai? Karolina: Stanford. Jack: Cool! Tujhe pata hai? Mujhe lag raha hai mai shayad help kar sakta hu. Karolina: Serious hai kya? Jack: Maybe. Mujhe abhi bhi kuch details confirm karni hai, but meri badi behen Stanford jaati hai and wo keh rahi thi ki uski roommate was going to leave and her and their other roomate was panicking ki ab wo rent kese denge. Maybe it could work. Karolina: Oh my God, Agar ye possible hai toh I'll be forever thankful. Jack: Ek baar just mujhe apni behen se baat karne de. Or better yet, mai tujhe uska number hi de deta hu and tu usse directly baat kar liyo. I'm sure she knows way more about this than i do. Karolina: Thank you, Jack, for real. Jack: Don't mention it.
