Fred: Hey girl, kesi hai! Saskia: Shattered Fred! Lovely to hear from you. Tu kesa hai? Fred: Getting there, day by day...tum ek ache insaan ko kabhi neeche nahi rakh sakte! Tu kya kar rahi hai? Saskia: Akeli hu aaj, Adam's Doncaster gaya hai, of all places, ek super-duper kebab van check out karne. Some sort of silver Airstream trailer thing! Fred: God, your man and his kebab fetish! Wo kabhi khatam nahi hota! Saskia: I know! What with Adam and Uncle Yann, parties mei sirf hum iski hi baat karte hai. Mujhe toh mere doners sirf mere shish kebabs se pata hai. Fred: Mujhe sach mei koi clue nahi tu kya keh rahi hai babes! Saskia: Never mind love, it doesn't matter! Fred: Fancy a drink, mai toh ek do gin le sakta hu? Saskia: Aaj raat nahi, kafi thak gayi hu. Mai friday ko shehar jhel hi nahi sakti, it's heaving with kids! Fred: OK old lady. Mere ghar aaja, I'm just about to get stuck into a lovely bottle of chilled Chablis and some prawn linguine. Saskia: Posh aur swadisht lagta hai. 2 logo ke liye kaafi hai? Fred: Always enough for you, sweetie! Wo Paddy ki favorite wine thi, yaad hai? Saskia: Oh yes, darling! Mai Paddy ko kaafi miss karti hu. Fred: Mai bhi. Saskia: Right, mai kuch ice cream aur chocs le aungi dessert ke liye. Jald hi milte hai! Love you xx Fred: Love you too xxx
