Anne: Iss weekend meri cousin aa rahi hai aur me usse kissi bdiya jga leke jaana chahti hu, koi idea? :) Tom: Angelo's lejao - town ka best pizza milta hai, prices bhi decent hai aur table cloths bhi nice, classic red-white chequered style ke hai, very Italian! Anne: Thanks a lot! Me bhi Angelo's soch rahi thi , but meri cousin Italian hai so thoda risky hoga usse Italian restaurant se impress krna;) Carl: Shi baat. Toff's lejaao usse? Unke fish and chips pure Uk me best hai. Anne: kabhi suna nhi ! Kaha hai yeh? Carl: Third zone, near Highgate. Area bahot beautiful hai waha ka, really worth going,khaskr jb koi phli baar london aaya ho Sarah: agar tum kuch central dhoond rhi ho toh i highly recommend Yori. Korean restaurant hai, hera hai hera <3 Anne: Prices kesse hai waha ke? hum budget pr nhi hai but me thode paise touristic stuff ke liye save ho jaaye toh kya bura hai ;) Sarah: Cool,mereko Yori affordable lga and mere khayal se unki prive-value bhi kaafi high hai. Carl: Same for the Toff's, voh jadatr fish aur fish and chips be chte hai, so ek baar tum apni cousin se puch lo ki usse yeh pasand bhi hai. Anna: Oh, Me shart lga skti hu ki usse London me fish and chips ke sath Instagram worthy photo kichaane bahoot pasand aayega , hahaha! Tom: Agar me tumhari jga hota toh me usse bars leke jaata ;) Fancy chodo usse Soho lejaao. Anna: Obviously! Mene phle se hi kuch places sochi hui hai. Usse mitha khaana bhi bahot pasand hai, toh me usse Hummingbird leke jaane ka soch rhi thi? Sarah: I think I may be joining you for that one! If not, take the salted caramel for my sake. Anna: Always! I always go for the red velvet, even if Tom thinks it's overrated. Tom: Because it is, it's just a normal cake with red dye in it. Sarah: So Tom is definitely not going to Hummingbird with us :D Party pooper :P Carl: How long is your cousin staying? Anna: Four days so that's four lunches/dinners - waiting for your recommendations! Tom: Hm... I would also suggest street food on Brick Lane or Borough's Market - if a party pooper may have something to say :P Sarah: But never on a weekend! Unless you fancy getting stomped or like to waiting for your food like FOREVER. When is he coming? Anna: Thursday to Sunday, so Thursday after flight it is then. Fortunately, he's flying in the morning. Thank you so much guys! Carl: Our pleasure, as long as tum hmaare liye monday ko cupcakes le aaogi toh :D Sarah: Yeah, Tom ke liye three red velvets :P
