Lena: Simon, Ik do cheeze mujhe struck ki jab mai us file ko dekh rhi thi jo tumne kl di thi. Simon: Oh Lena, kya surprise hai (!) Lena: Esa lag raha hai k notes kuch kum hai aur kuch underlying issues bhi explore ni hue hai. Simon: Mujhe toh humesha vo adequate hi lge hai. Lena: Yes, but Simon,Mere paas kai kids is term k alg alg points ki clarification k lie aae hai, unhe sach me is kam ki scheme k kuch parts k bare me smjh ni aya. Simon: Really? ye mere lie ik news hai, mujhe esi koi complaints ni milli. Lena: I mean, tum thore intimidating ho skte ho, Simon aur vo sab abhi young hai. Simon: Lena, Mai 30 saal se teaching kr raha hu, koi discipline issues ni hai aur bhot kam problemsaai hai, if I'm honest. Lena: Well yes, mai tumhari knowledge aur experience ki respect krti hu, pr hum me se koi bhi totally perfectni h. Simon: OK, mai sochta hu k agar bacho ne omplain ki hai toh, vo puri tarah comprehensible ni ho skti. Lena: Look, next week se half term hai, Mai new scheme of work bna lungi ghr pe aur hum use apply krke dekhege jab hum vapis aege, Josh ko bhi dikhana, vo bhi permanently aa raha h ab islie. Simon: Well, OK, Shayad mai thora casual aur slapdash ho jata hu kabhi kabhi, Mai tumhari vigorous approach me lack kr jata hu! Lena: Well, Hume ispe ik sath km krna chahiye kyuki hum dono ise parha rahe h, aur Josh bhi, of course. Hume apne ideas lgaane chahiye aur unhe discuss krna chahiye. Simon: OK, Lena, Tumhari baat me point hai! Hope ye ab last message ho, Mere paas meri favourite book hai aur ik wine ka glass mera wait kr rha hai. Coincidentally, Lena mujhe lagta hai tumhe bhi chill krna chahiye! Lena: I will! Kl milte hai! Simon: Bye, Lena!
