Freddie: Toh Brexit finally hone vala hai? Isla: Lag toh raha hai. Abhi bhi bht kuch hona usme baki hai pr hardest part se. Shayad! Freddie: Ireland k bare me kya khyaal hai? Isla: Shayad vo abhi bhi use bahar nikaalne ka soch rahe hai. Visas aur passports bhi. Aur customs. Aur... Freddie: Geez. Toh ko settle kya krege? Isla: Immigration toh ek alag cheez hai. important stuff toh yeh hai ki kisne kisko paise dene hai ya lene hai. Freddie: Riiiight. Isla: After all, immigration hi toh reason hai jo unhone han me vote dia. Freddie: Aur country ki NIMBY's? Isla: Yes, unhone dekha k immigrants British culture ko dilute kr rhe hai aur sare resources khraab kr rahe hai. Freddie: Acha Isla: Kuch cases me galat nahi hai, pr yaha kuch countries hai jo EU ka part ni honi chahiye thi. Turkey bhi unme se ik hai! Freddie: ye vahi hai na jaha se tum ho? Isla: Meri family originally, yes. Freddie: Interesting!
