Marion: Dear Rita, tumne last night lift di thi uske liye thank you bolna tha. Rita: Morning Marion, my pleasure! Marion: Tumse baat krke acha lga. Tum kaafi sensible person ho. Rita: Thank you. Tum bahoot kind ho. Well, Mujhe bhi tumse baat krke acha lga. Marion: Humne concert hall tk gaadi exchange krne ka phle kyo nhi socha. Rita: Humko ye future me bhi try krna chahiye. Marion: By all means. Parking fees bhi exorbitant ho gyi hai naa. Rita: Oh yes. aur khali spot find krne bhi bahot time lgta hai! Marion: So next month meri turn hai. Rita: In fact maine abhi check kiya, the next concert two weeks me hai. Marion: Ooops! You're right.yeh 12 November ko hi hai. And ye kaafi bda programme hai! Rita: Yes, Me isme jana chahti hu but is it OK if me apne son ko sath le aau? Marion: of course! usse dobaara mil kr acha lgega mujhe. Rita: Thank you, Marion! Marion: mention not. Anyway a day or two beforehand hum sb sort kr lenge, OK? Rita: yup. have a lovely day ahead! Marion: You too!
