Camilla: Hello dear 😊 tumhari trip kessi chl rahi hai? Marge: Oh, trip to wonderful chl rahi hai ! weather bhi perfect hai. jada sunny bhi nhi hai, tumhe toh pta hai oppressive weather meri health pr bura asar daalta hai. yaha ke log kaafi hospitable and warm hai, but maybe mere taste ke hisaab se thoda jayda exuberant hai. Camilla: food kessa hai yaha ka? Marge: Spicy and stodgy, but Frank to food ko lekr pagal hi ho gya hai. Voh kuch nya taste kr ske isliye voh mujhe city center jaane ke liye force krta rhta hai. Camilla: Marge tumhe itna complain bhi nhi krna chahiye. After all, tum dono ek sath kuch quality time spend kr rahe ho. Marge: Oh, but you know me. mujhe bahar jana kuch khaas psnd nhi, essa nhi hai ki i am staying in hotel but food ke piche bhagne se acha I prefer to sit in the sun with a good book. And voh meri life ko little bit harder bna raha hai. But mere baare me bahot baate ho gyi ! How are you? Camilla: Fine, thank you.Mai aaj completely alone thi, because Harry subha fishing ke liye chle gye the, but I think mereko bhi thoda bahar jaana chahiye, maybe thodi shopping hi kr aati hu. Hmare pass rosemary khatam ho gyi hai and freshly caught salmon ke sath uska mazza hi kuch alag hai. We’ll stay in touch, dear. Enjoy your trip! Marge: Ha jaroor! Take care, dear.
